<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="piraiders-csrf" content="{{csrfToken}}">
  <title>Game Day · PiRaiders</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/piraiders-game-day.css">
  <script src="/js/piraiders-game-day.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body data-mode="{{#if sourceMode}}source{{else}}local{{/if}}">
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to Game Day</a>
  <header class="app-header">
    <a class="brand" href="/">PiRaiders<span>Broadcast Engine</span></a>
    <nav aria-label="Workspaces"><a href="/game-day" aria-current="page">Game Day</a><a href="/shows">SPX Graphics</a></nav>
    <span id="connection" class="connection" role="status">Connecting to application…</span>
  </header>
  <main id="main">
    <div class="page-heading"><div><h1>Game Day</h1><p>Prepare an event, then activate its playback controls.</p></div><button id="retry" type="button" hidden>Retry connection</button></div>
    <div id="connection-warning" class="message warning" hidden><p id="connection-detail"></p><a id="sign-in" href="/login" hidden>Sign in to SPX</a><a id="configure-spx" href="/config" hidden>Open SPX configuration</a><button id="reload-page" type="button" hidden>Reload Game Day</button></div>
    {{#if sourceMode}}<div id="source-mode-note" class="message source-note"><p>This PC reads events from the scheduler’s exchange folder. Approve a board button for this PC under Exchange events, then prepare and activate it under Approved board buttons.</p></div>{{/if}}
    <p id="notice" class="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading event status…</p>
    <div class="workspace">
      {{#if sourceMode}}<section id="source-section" class="event-section source-section" aria-labelledby="source-heading">
        <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="source-heading">Exchange events</h2><button id="source-refresh" class="quiet" type="button">Refresh from exchange</button></div>
        <p id="source-summary" class="support" role="status" aria-live="polite">Not read yet.</p>
        <div id="source-problem" class="message warning" hidden><p id="source-problem-text"></p><button id="source-problem-refresh" type="button" hidden>Refresh from exchange</button></div>
        <div id="source-events-block" hidden>
          <h3 id="source-events-heading" class="list-heading">Events</h3>
          <ul id="source-events" class="choice-list" aria-labelledby="source-events-heading"></ul>
          <button id="source-more-events" class="wide" type="button" hidden>Show more events</button>
        </div>
        <div id="source-event" hidden>
          <h3 id="source-selections-heading" class="list-heading" tabindex="-1">Boards and buttons</h3>
          <p id="source-event-detail" class="support"></p>
          <ul id="source-selections" class="choice-list" aria-labelledby="source-selections-heading"></ul>
          <button id="source-more-selections" class="wide" type="button" hidden>Show more boards and buttons</button>
        </div>
        <div id="source-choice" class="candidate" hidden>
          <h3 id="source-choice-heading" tabindex="-1">Chosen board button</h3>
          <dl class="details">
            <div><dt>Event</dt><dd id="source-choice-event"></dd></div>
            <div><dt>Board</dt><dd id="source-choice-board"></dd></div>
            <div><dt>Button</dt><dd id="source-choice-button"></dd></div>
            <div><dt>Pictures</dt><dd id="source-choice-pictures"></dd></div>
            <div><dt>Generation</dt><dd id="source-choice-generation" class="version"></dd></div>
          </dl>
          <p id="source-check-note" class="support">Check this button to see the scheduler’s times and approve it for this PC. Approving prepares and plays nothing; output is unchanged.</p>
          <button id="source-check" class="wide" type="button">Check this button</button>
          <div id="source-review" class="review" hidden>
            <h3 id="source-review-heading" tabindex="-1">Approval on this PC</h3>
            <dl class="details">
              <div><dt>Checked version</dt><dd id="source-review-version" class="version"></dd></div>
              <div><dt>Scheduler times</dt><dd id="source-review-times"></dd></div>
              <div><dt>Approval</dt><dd id="source-review-approval"></dd></div>
            </dl>
            <p id="source-review-flags" class="support" hidden></p>
            <form id="source-window" class="window-form" novalidate>
              <fieldset>
                <legend>Production window to approve</legend>
                <label for="source-window-start">Start</label>
                <input id="source-window-start" type="datetime-local" step="60" required aria-describedby="source-window-clock">
                <label for="source-window-end">End</label>
                <input id="source-window-end" type="datetime-local" step="60" required aria-describedby="source-window-clock">
                <label for="source-window-prewarm">Warm-up before the start, in minutes</label>
                <input id="source-window-prewarm" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="0" max="60" step="1" value="15" required>
                <p id="source-window-clock" class="support">Enter times on this PC’s clock. The confirmation shows them in Central time.</p>
              </fieldset>
              <button id="source-approve" class="primary wide" type="submit">Approve for this window…</button>
            </form>
            <p id="source-review-message" class="message" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
            <button id="source-revoke" class="danger wide" type="button" hidden>Revoke approval…</button>
            <div id="source-confirm" class="message confirm" role="group" aria-labelledby="source-confirm-text" hidden>
              <p id="source-confirm-text" tabindex="-1"></p>
              <div class="button-pair"><button id="source-confirm-yes" class="primary" type="button"></button><button id="source-confirm-no" type="button">Cancel</button></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>{{/if}}
      <section id="prepare-section" class="event-section prepare-section" aria-labelledby="events-heading">
        <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="events-heading">{{#if sourceMode}}Approved board buttons{{else}}Event preparation{{/if}}</h2><button id="refresh-events" class="quiet" type="button">Refresh list</button></div>
        <label for="event-select">{{#if sourceMode}}Approved button{{else}}Local event{{/if}}</label>
        <select id="event-select" aria-describedby="catalog-note" disabled><option>Loading events…</option></select>
        <p id="catalog-note" class="support">{{#if sourceMode}}Reading this PC’s approved board buttons.{{else}}Reading the local event list.{{/if}}</p>
        <button id="prepare" class="primary wide" type="button" disabled>{{#if sourceMode}}Prepare selected button{{else}}Prepare selected event{{/if}}</button>
        <p id="protection" class="support" hidden>The current production window protects event changes. Playback controls remain available.</p>
        <div id="candidate" class="candidate" hidden>
          <h3 id="candidate-heading" tabindex="-1">Prepared event</h3>
          <p id="candidate-name" class="event-name"></p>
          <p id="candidate-status" class="support"></p>
          <dl class="details"><div><dt>Event settings version</dt><dd id="candidate-version" class="version"></dd></div></dl>
          <div class="button-pair"><button id="activate" class="primary" type="button" disabled>Activate event</button><button id="discard" type="button" disabled>Discard</button></div>
          <p class="support">Activation opens this event’s controls. The sender follows its production window.</p>
        </div>
        {{#if sourceMode}}<div class="local-note"><h3>Exchange pictures</h3><p>Preparation reads this button’s pictures from the exchange folder and checks every one. A button whose approval is revoked or changed cannot be activated or started.</p></div>{{else}}<div class="local-note"><h3>Local media</h3><p>Preparation validates a local media snapshot. Reload checks for updated media and keeps the last accepted content if preparation fails.</p></div>{{/if}}
      </section>
      <section class="playback-section" aria-labelledby="playback-heading">
        <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="playback-heading" tabindex="-1">Playback</h2><span id="runtime-state" class="status-label">No active event</span></div>
        <div class="active-summary"><h3 id="active-name">Activate a prepared event</h3><p id="active-detail">Prepare an event on the left to begin.</p></div>
        <dl class="readiness">
          <div><dt>Renderer</dt><dd id="renderer-status">Not started</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Output configuration</dt><dd id="output-status">No active event</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Receiver / board route</dt><dd>Unverified</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <div class="playback-position"><span id="slide-position">No slide selected</span><span id="mode">Mode unavailable</span></div>
        <div class="playback-controls" role="group" aria-label="Playback controls">
          <button data-action="launch" id="launch" class="primary" type="button" disabled>Launch slide 1</button>
          <button data-action="previous" type="button" disabled>Previous</button>
          <button data-action="next" type="button" disabled>Next</button>
          <button data-action="auto" id="auto" type="button" aria-pressed="false" disabled>Auto</button>
          <button data-action="manual" id="manual" type="button" aria-pressed="false" disabled>Manual</button>
          <button data-action="reload" id="reload-media" type="button" disabled>Reload media</button>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-row"><button id="stop" class="danger" type="button" disabled>Stop · black output</button><p>Stop requests black. Sender shutdown remains controlled by the production window.</p></div>
        <dl class="window-details"><div><dt>Production window</dt><dd id="window-range">No active event</dd></div><div><dt>Prewarm</dt><dd id="window-prewarm">Not configured</dd></div></dl>
        <p id="runtime-error" class="message warning" hidden></p>
        <p class="verification-note">Renderer readiness does not confirm receiver connection or board routing.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <footer><span>SPX native graphics and rundowns remain available in <a href="/shows">SPX Graphics</a>.</span><span>Closing this tab leaves the application running.</span></footer>
  <noscript><p class="message warning">JavaScript is required for Game Day controls. Existing <a href="/shows">SPX Graphics</a> remains available.</p></noscript>
</body>
</html>
